WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Open EDM Templates in the local Docker WebHDP instance.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Open the Standard EDM Template editor.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Run template validation, which renders sample EDM XML first.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Review the validation report and Local EDM Validator steps.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Confirm Basic, XSD, Schematron, Business, and Remote checks are visible.
